WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:04.880
Big brother, is it true that 
humans made airplanes?

00:04.880 --> 00:06.580
Ow. It is.

00:06.580 --> 00:07.360
Really?

00:07.360 --> 00:08.850
I just said it is.

00:09.830 --> 00:12.080
You know, this is a really 
hard level right now.

00:12.080 --> 00:13.630
Really, really?

00:15.470 --> 00:16.850
It really is.

00:16.850 --> 00:20.440
There's man-made stuff all around us.

00:20.890 --> 00:24.370
All of it exists because someone somewhere 
put some serious thought into it.

00:24.370 --> 00:25.340
This too?

00:24.370 --> 00:25.750
<b>Picture book</b>

00:24.370 --> 00:25.750
<b>Picture book</b>

00:25.340 --> 00:25.850
Yup.

00:25.830 --> 00:27.210
<b>Cup</b>

00:25.830 --> 00:27.210
<b>Cup</b>

00:25.850 --> 00:26.630
This too?

00:26.630 --> 00:27.280
Yup.

00:27.280 --> 00:28.090
And this?

00:27.290 --> 00:28.670
<b>Clothes</b>

00:27.290 --> 00:28.670
<b>Clothes</b>

00:28.090 --> 00:28.760
Yeah.

00:28.750 --> 00:30.130
<b>TV</b>

00:28.750 --> 00:30.130
<b>TV</b>

00:28.760 --> 00:29.740
And this?

00:29.740 --> 00:30.220
Yeah.

00:30.210 --> 00:33.180
But we even took
 a picture together...

00:30.430 --> 00:31.590
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:30.830 --> 00:33.300
Even the bear cubs, 
Ramune-kun and Ichigo-chan?

00:33.300 --> 00:35.600
Ye—No, they're living things!

00:36.170 --> 00:37.470
I see!

00:37.830 --> 00:40.210
I'm going to make something too!

00:40.860 --> 00:42.980
Yeah, please play by yourself...

00:43.490 --> 00:45.840
<i>The world is full of wonderful things.</i>

00:46.260 --> 00:49.930
<i>And every single thing carries 
someone's intention or wish.</i>

00:50.500 --> 00:53.020
<i>To a degree that it's really distracting.</i>

02:23.370 --> 02:23.500
Weather in Kanagawa / Sunny

02:23.490 --> 02:28.000
<b>#24 
Cool and
 Awkward Guys</b>

02:23.500 --> 02:23.620
Weather in Kanagawa / Sunny

02:23.620 --> 02:23.750
Weather in Kanagawa / Sunny

02:23.750 --> 02:24.540
Weather in Kanagawa / Sunny

02:24.530 --> 02:26.530
<i>Still no response.</i>

02:26.900 --> 02:29.990
<i>I guess she didn't like the CD cover.</i>

02:31.150 --> 02:33.050
Wow, these bento boxes are amazing!

02:33.050 --> 02:34.340
My sister forced me to take them.

02:34.340 --> 02:35.450
Have fun!

02:35.700 --> 02:39.710
So Shun's big sister is the owner of 
the cafe where Souma works, right?

02:39.710 --> 02:41.330
She's done so much for him.

02:41.330 --> 02:43.450
I need to go and properly introduce myself.

02:43.450 --> 02:45.970
Hayate, aren't you also 
working there part-time?

02:45.970 --> 02:46.920
Yes.

02:46.920 --> 02:47.970
What are you doing?

02:47.970 --> 02:50.400
This band I like just uploaded a new song.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.620
So you're an Onizero fan.

02:52.620 --> 02:53.530
You know them?!

02:52.690 --> 02:53.150
<b>Whaaa</b>

02:54.320 --> 02:56.120
I'm friends with the band.

02:57.260 --> 02:58.570
What's Onizero?

02:58.570 --> 03:09.410
<b>Oni Yasaiseikatsu Day 0</b>

02:58.860 --> 03:03.430
Onizero stands for "Oni Yasaiseikatsu Day 0." 
It's a four-person rock band.

03:03.430 --> 03:05.380
"They're cool but also kind of lame."

03:05.380 --> 03:08.590
Their fans really like them because 
of that sort of imperfection.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.400
Ahh...

03:09.680 --> 03:13.060
Oh, I helped with the lyrics for this one.

03:13.060 --> 03:14.200
Are you serious?!

03:14.200 --> 03:16.640
I always listen to this before our games!

03:16.640 --> 03:17.830
It's true!

03:17.830 --> 03:20.010
Your name is credited here 
as one of the songwriters!

03:20.400 --> 03:23.340
I'm so glad I got your signature back then.

03:21.010 --> 03:23.220
Good luck!

03:21.010 --> 03:24.640
To Shun

03:21.010 --> 03:24.640
Igarashi
Motoharu

03:23.340 --> 03:24.630
You're so honest.

03:24.630 --> 03:28.120
Will you sign one of the CDs that 
you wrote the lyrics for next time?

03:28.120 --> 03:30.690
That's totally fine, but it'd 
be boring to just give it away.

03:30.690 --> 03:32.260
So let's play beach volleyball for it.

03:32.560 --> 03:34.420
Hayate-san, weren't you 
in the volleyball club?

03:34.420 --> 03:35.770
Please be on my team!

03:35.770 --> 03:36.320
Huh?

03:36.320 --> 03:39.690
Then I'll summon the tall 
Takayuki as my partner.

03:36.320 --> 03:42.400
Onigashima Rhapsody        
Even Someone Like Me

03:39.690 --> 03:40.420
What?

03:40.420 --> 03:42.410
<i>All of these covers are good.</i>

03:42.980 --> 03:46.620
<i>Every day, I'm getting inspiration from
the designs that are all around me.</i>

03:46.900 --> 03:48.310
<i>They encouraged me,</i>

03:48.310 --> 03:50.090
<i>or whipped me into action at times,</i>

03:50.090 --> 03:51.840
<i>but I always learned a lot.</i>

03:52.700 --> 03:54.170
<i>But right now,</i>

03:54.950 --> 03:57.340
<i>that stimulus is too much.</i>

03:57.340 --> 03:58.540
Souma.

03:58.810 --> 04:01.090
You're not playing beach volleyball?

04:01.090 --> 04:02.430
I'm fine.

04:04.630 --> 04:05.900
What about you?

04:06.860 --> 04:10.150
Do you sometimes think that everyone 
else's stuff is always better?

04:10.880 --> 04:13.600
You mean how the grass is 
greener on the other side?

04:13.600 --> 04:15.310
That happens to everyone.

04:15.310 --> 04:16.490
Why do you ask?

04:15.310 --> 04:16.530
<b>Pant</b>

04:16.820 --> 04:18.030
<b>Pant</b>

04:17.100 --> 04:18.740
The adult team sucks.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.540
<b>Pant</b>

04:20.100 --> 04:22.390
It's nothing.

04:24.520 --> 04:26.440
I'm not sure what this is about,

04:26.440 --> 04:29.030
but with confidence comes a feeling 
that you can recover from anything.

04:29.670 --> 04:34.100
Don't get so wrapped up in other people that 
you lose sight of what's good about you.

04:34.100 --> 04:37.940
I've liked the things you 
make basically since forever,

04:37.940 --> 04:38.850
so be more confident!

04:39.460 --> 04:42.050
<i>Your own goodness and confidence...</i>

04:42.780 --> 04:44.630
<i>Where can you get those things?</i>

04:46.140 --> 04:47.750
I'm pooped!

04:47.750 --> 04:49.810
How late are we staying?

04:49.810 --> 04:51.500
I heard that we're leaving before sundown.

04:51.500 --> 04:52.840
That's pretty soon.

04:54.650 --> 04:55.490
Hayate-san,

04:55.490 --> 04:57.810
I never pictured you as 
someone who likes the beach,

04:57.810 --> 04:59.410
but I was way off, huh?

04:59.410 --> 05:00.430
I thought the same thing!

05:00.430 --> 05:01.650
Really?

05:01.650 --> 05:03.440
Growing up, I did go to 
the beach quite a lot.

05:03.770 --> 05:06.680
Hey! Start getting ready to leave soon!

05:06.680 --> 05:07.670
Okay!

05:10.710 --> 05:13.140
Shun-kun, you didn't bring 
a change of clothes?

05:13.140 --> 05:14.320
On purpose.

05:14.670 --> 05:16.320
I'm going to run so they dry!

05:16.540 --> 05:17.750
<i>And he's off.</i>

05:16.750 --> 05:18.500
<b>Deflate</b>

05:17.750 --> 05:18.410
Huh?

05:18.410 --> 05:19.580
Where did Shun-kun go?

05:19.580 --> 05:21.780
He's running to get his swim trunks dry.

05:21.780 --> 05:24.150
Surely there were other solutions for that.

05:22.550 --> 05:23.260
<b>Glance</b>

05:24.010 --> 05:24.760
<b>Ding</b>

05:24.010 --> 05:24.760
<b>New message</b>

05:25.720 --> 05:26.910
<i>She wrote back!</i>

05:26.910 --> 05:28.790
I returned the parasol!

05:28.790 --> 05:29.370
Huh?

05:29.370 --> 05:30.060
Where's Shun?

05:30.060 --> 05:32.340
He went on a run to dry his swim trunks.

05:32.340 --> 05:33.890
He's a bit of an idiot, huh?

05:33.890 --> 05:38.100
<b>New message from rina-san</b>

05:33.890 --> 05:38.100
<b>Hey lol</b>

05:33.890 --> 05:38.100
<b>I don't even know where to begin ;-; lol</b>

05:34.300 --> 05:37.090
Why don't we put our stuff in the 
car and then go grab ice cream?

05:37.090 --> 05:38.090
Great idea.

05:38.480 --> 05:40.900
Hey, Souma, want to come get some ice cream?

05:40.900 --> 05:41.660
I'm good.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.490
I'm going to go check out 
the sunset by myself.

05:45.520 --> 05:47.520
He's that age.

05:47.520 --> 05:48.950
I was there too once.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.910
The sunset <i>is</i> beautiful.

05:51.540 --> 05:57.110
<i>When you spend your days wielding your 
strengths to figure out what you really have,</i>

05:57.560 --> 06:00.110
<i>there are times when you can't 
get up from the wounds you get.</i>

06:01.650 --> 06:03.940
<i>I just want the ocean to wash me away.</i>

06:04.960 --> 06:07.140
<i>What about it did she not like?</i>

06:07.640 --> 06:11.580
<i>I should ask her and really make something 
that's in line with her vision.</i>

06:13.220 --> 06:15.120
<i>I'll just send you the cover images.</i>

06:13.220 --> 06:18.560
<b>I'll just send you the

 cover images. What do you think...</b>

06:15.120 --> 06:15.840
<i>What do you think...</i>

06:15.600 --> 06:18.560
<b>Hey lol        I don't even 
know where to begin ;_; lol</b>

06:15.840 --> 06:16.600
<i>Hey, lol.</i>

06:16.600 --> 06:18.570
<i>I don't even know where 
to begin‚ lol.</i>

06:20.520 --> 06:25.730
<b>Sorry</b>

06:20.520 --> 06:25.730
<b>I sent you the wrong image...</b>

06:20.530 --> 06:21.410
<i>Sorry.</i>

06:21.410 --> 06:22.950
<i>I sent you the wrong image...</i>

06:22.770 --> 06:25.730
<b>No problem</b>

06:22.770 --> 06:25.730
<b>I needed that lol</b>

06:22.950 --> 06:23.970
<i>No problem.</i>

06:23.970 --> 06:25.130
<i>I needed that, lol.</i>

06:24.780 --> 06:25.730
<b>The ones I'm sending 







now are the covers</b>

06:25.130 --> 06:27.170
<i>The ones I'm sending now 
are the covers.</i>

06:26.990 --> 06:27.490
<b>Send</b>

06:30.220 --> 06:31.650
No way...

06:35.040 --> 06:35.830
<b>SLAM</b>

06:36.910 --> 06:37.040
<b>Brace!</b>

06:37.200 --> 06:37.330
<b>Roll</b>

06:37.790 --> 06:38.040
<b>Land!</b>

06:38.510 --> 06:39.710
What the hell are you doing,

06:38.710 --> 06:39.710
<b>Turn</b>

06:40.420 --> 06:42.490
lying in a place like that?

06:42.490 --> 06:43.420
That's so dangerous!

06:43.690 --> 06:44.740
Get up!

06:44.740 --> 06:46.410
I know.

06:46.870 --> 06:48.130
It hurts.

06:48.570 --> 06:51.190
<i>I don't have enough experience 
or accomplishments</i>

06:51.190 --> 06:53.720
<i>for me to have unwavering confidence yet,</i>

06:53.720 --> 06:55.600
<i>but that doesn't mean I can just cower.</i>

06:55.720 --> 06:57.810
<b>Ring</b>

07:00.160 --> 07:00.880
Yes?

07:00.880 --> 07:02.160
<i>Shiki-kun?</i>

07:02.160 --> 07:04.020
<i>I was so excited, I just had to call you!</i>

07:04.020 --> 07:05.770
<i>Thank you so much for the covers!</i>

07:05.770 --> 07:07.490
<i>I love them so much!</i>

07:08.220 --> 07:11.330
Um, is there something 
you'd like changed, or...

07:11.330 --> 07:12.870
<i>Not really.</i>

07:12.870 --> 07:14.090
<i>Well, if I had to say something,</i>

07:14.090 --> 07:15.460
<i>since I want to use both,</i>

07:15.460 --> 07:17.610
<i>I was thinking of using 
one for the track list.</i>

07:17.910 --> 07:21.090
<i>Would it be okay to ask you to 
make that kind of change?</i>

07:21.090 --> 07:22.830
Yeah, that's no problem at all.

07:23.290 --> 07:25.110
So you really are okay with it?

07:25.110 --> 07:26.460
<i>What's wrong?</i>

07:26.460 --> 07:27.620
<i>Have more confidence in yourself!</i>

07:27.620 --> 07:30.340
<i>You've got a happy client right here!</i>

07:30.340 --> 07:34.470
<i>I didn't think that you would make 
something that captures me so well.</i>

07:34.470 --> 07:36.960
<i>I'm so glad I asked you to do it.</i>

07:38.260 --> 07:40.930
<i>The world is full of wonderful things.</i>

07:40.930 --> 07:44.800
<i>And every single thing carries 
someone's intention or wish.</i>

07:45.540 --> 07:46.990
Big brother, I'm done!

07:46.990 --> 07:47.620
Look!

07:47.620 --> 07:48.730
It's for you!

07:48.730 --> 07:50.210
Wow! Can I really have this?

07:50.210 --> 07:52.280
But I messed up a little right here.

07:52.280 --> 07:53.850
Don't worry about that.

07:53.850 --> 07:55.460
Wow, there's a snack attached!

07:55.780 --> 07:57.890
I put that there in case you get hungry.

07:57.890 --> 07:59.570
You like these, right?

07:59.570 --> 08:01.150
You know me so well.

08:01.470 --> 08:05.420
Looks like you're really thinking about 
the person you're making it for.

08:05.420 --> 08:08.620
<i>The times when that feeling gets 
across and makes them happy...</i>

08:08.960 --> 08:09.960
Thank you.

08:09.960 --> 08:11.550
That's what's good about you.

08:11.550 --> 08:12.420
Yeah!

08:12.420 --> 08:15.250
<i>...I need to collect the small 
bits of confidence they give me,</i>

08:15.250 --> 08:17.060
<i>and treasure them.</i>

08:17.420 --> 08:19.580
Hey, we're going now!

08:22.950 --> 08:24.300
It's so quiet.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.730
<b>Sleep</b>

08:25.770 --> 08:27.480
<b>Sleep</b>

08:26.400 --> 08:26.690
<b>Nod</b>

08:26.500 --> 08:27.490
Is everyone asleep?

08:27.480 --> 08:28.440
<b>Sleep</b>

08:27.830 --> 08:28.860
Yeah.

08:28.860 --> 08:30.570
Very soundly, too.

08:30.690 --> 08:31.150
<b>Snap</b>

08:31.390 --> 08:33.140
<i>You are approaching your destination.</i>

08:33.140 --> 08:33.690
Wha?

08:33.690 --> 08:34.850
That can't be.

08:34.850 --> 08:37.360
Oh, you set the wrong destination.

08:37.360 --> 08:40.030
Neither of us noticed that?

08:44.610 --> 08:45.760
What is it?

08:47.770 --> 08:49.030
Fireworks!

08:52.260 --> 08:55.180
I guess today was the day 
of the fireworks show.

08:55.180 --> 08:57.310
It's been a while since I saw some.

08:55.950 --> 08:56.920
Phew!

08:57.310 --> 08:59.620
So I guess this is thanks 
to the GPS being wrong.

08:59.620 --> 09:01.310
You really got it, Mima-san.

09:01.310 --> 09:02.660
Well done, Takayuki!

09:03.300 --> 09:06.190
Oh, apparently this is the best 
secret spot to watch them from.

09:06.190 --> 09:06.880
Huh.

09:07.240 --> 09:09.220
Tamaya!

09:09.220 --> 09:11.380
I've never heard anyone 
say that in real life.

09:11.380 --> 09:12.060
Really?

09:16.690 --> 09:17.780
Wow.

09:17.980 --> 09:19.030
Wow.

09:19.030 --> 09:20.000
So pretty.

09:20.780 --> 09:22.450
<i>I'm not good with people,</i>

09:22.830 --> 09:25.900
<i>and there's nothing super special about me.</i>

09:26.460 --> 09:31.320
<i>So I never imagined that my life could 
ever lead to something like this.</i>

09:33.000 --> 09:34.850
It would be nice to come here again together.

09:35.960 --> 09:38.690
Yes, let's all come here again next year.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.220
Agreed!

09:40.220 --> 09:41.000
Yeah!

09:44.170 --> 09:45.050
All right,

09:45.050 --> 09:47.340
why doesn't this old guy take 
a picture of all of you?

09:47.340 --> 09:48.700
Nice one, Shiki-san!

09:49.080 --> 09:50.850
Okay everybody, get together.

09:50.850 --> 09:51.730
Yus.

09:51.730 --> 09:54.160
Oh, Souma and Shun, you 
should go a step lower.

09:54.800 --> 09:56.040
How about now?

09:56.040 --> 09:56.950
Yeah.

09:56.950 --> 09:58.990
Oh, Hayate, get a bit closer.

09:59.260 --> 10:00.740
I'll take it now!

10:00.740 --> 10:02.350
Watch for the step there—

10:05.450 --> 10:08.960
<i>I'm sure you have people 
like this around you too.</i>

10:08.960 --> 10:11.160
<i>They're so cool, good looking,</i>

10:11.160 --> 10:13.040
<i>and yet slightly...</i>

10:13.040 --> 10:14.700
<i>awkward guys.</i>

10:15.340 --> 10:16.920
<i>After you get to know them,</i>

10:16.920 --> 10:19.710
<i>your days will be a lot more fun.</i>

11:04.980 --> 11:09.970
<b>The End</b>

11:04.980 --> 11:09.970
<b>The End</b>
